        <rule id="6fd82421-a944-54d7-ac2f-b0332f805905" name="Legion Kratos" hidden="false">
          <description>PAGE 57
Legion Kratos – 300 Points – Heavy Support
                                                                             BS                FRONT SIDE                      REAR     HP

