                                                                Warlord: The Line Unbroken

Warlord Trait: The Line Unbroken – At the end of the controlling player’s turn, if a Warlord with this Trait is
within 3" of an Objective marker that they control, the controlling player can declare that this Warlord will
activate The Line Unbroken. Until the end of the battle, while this Warlord is within 3" of that Objective marker,
they have the Fearless and Counter-attack special rules.

Defiant to the End

While Camba Diaz has only one would remaining, he gains the Feel No Pain 4+ special rule

