        <rule id="3662-4779-93c4-1399" name="Father to the Brethren of Iron" publicationId="ca571888--pubN80998" page="101" hidden="false">
          <description>A Forge Lord (or Iron-Father or Warsmith) must be taken as the compulsory HQ choice for this detachment if this Rite of War is used as the army’s Primary Detachment. Note that this will preclude certain other characters from being included in the detachment, and means in most cases that both a Legion Praetor and a Forge Lord must be taken.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
