            <profile id="0e7b-9830-9aae-f298" name="The Medusan Carapace" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187" page="53" hidden="false" typeId="57617267656172204974656d23232344415441232323" typeName="Wargear Item">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">Confers 2+ save and 3+ Invulnerable. Also contains a nuncio-vox and servo-arm.  Ferrus Manus may fire two weapons from the following list (at the same target) during the shooting phase.    - Plasma Blaster - Graviton Gun - Grenade Harness (unlimited use) - Heavy Flamer</characteristic>
