      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="59cc-cd20-bb90-1a4d" name="Lords of Ultramar" publicationId="ca571888--pubN68042" page="232" hidden="false">
          <description>Units with the Legiones Astartes (Ultramarines) as well as Allied Detachment units drawn from either the Solar Auxilia or Imperialis Militia army lists within 12" of an Invictarus Suzerain model which is itself not Pinned or Falling Back gain a 1 modifier to their Leadership value (up to 10).</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="1448-15cd-3ca7-cda0" name="Honour Bearers" publicationId="ca571888--pubN68042" page="232" hidden="false">
          <description>Invictarus Suzerain Squad may be chosen isntead of a Command Squad for any Praetor of the Ultramarines Legion (or any model with the Master of the Legion rule).  If this is the case, one of the Invictarus Suzerains must exchange their boarding shield for a Legion Standard as an Invictarus Ancient and must be so modelled.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
