        <selectionEntryGroup id="4683e141-87fb-5f88-85a2-ddb60862b840" name="HH 1.41 Disintegration Weapons" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true">
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry id="1fda8f89-aa14-5d4f-a046-0853cc6a84bc" name="Volkite Charger (replace bolter)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="99.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="c5ebfe13-68d5-5cf6-8ad8-405e272b8176" type="max" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="5.0" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="eda7dd07-9891-5dc2-b8a5-15dc1f4b2a01" name="Volkite Charger (replace bolter)" hidden="false">
                  <description>PAGE 56
Disintegrator Weapons and Additions


Legion Nullificator Squad
        Any Legion Nullificator may replace their Combi bolter for a Disintegrator Blaster for 20 Points.

Legion Veteran Squads
        Legion Veteran Squads may replace their Bolt guns with one of the following

    -   Volkite Charger – 5 points
    -   Disintegrator Rifle – 10 points

        Legion Veteran Sergeants may replace their bolt pistol with a Disintegrator Pistol for 15 points.

        For Every 5 models in a Legion Veteran Squad, one Veteran may replace their bolt gun with one of the
        following:
        Disintegrator Blaster – 15 points
        Heavy Disintegrator – 25 points

Heavy Disintegrator

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        24’            6          2       Rapid Fire, Gets Hot!, Instant Death

Disintegrator Cannon

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        24”            9          2       Heavy 2, Gets hot!, Instant Death

Disintegrator Rifle

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        24’            4          3       Assault 1, Gets hot!, Instant Death

Disintegrator Blaster

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        18’            5          2       Rapid fire, Gets hot!, Instant Death

Disintegrator Pistol

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        12’            4          3       Pistol 1, Gets Hot!, Instant Death</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="913efb50-eb38-53ec-8980-1802d1450c39" name="Disintegrator Rifle (replace bolter)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
