            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="52616e676523232344415441232323">24"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="537472656e67746823232344415441232323">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="415023232344415441232323">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="5479706523232344415441232323">Assault 3, Twin-linked, Rending</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="0720-8fb8-b6bd-9318" name="Sire of the Iron Warriors" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187" page="87" hidden="false">
          <description>All Perturabo's attacks have Wrecker and Tank Hunters.  Additionally, while Perturabo is on the table all models with Legiones Astartes (Iron Warriors) gain Stubborn</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="99f5-5dd1-3616-161a" name="Relentless Strategist" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187" page="87" hidden="false">
          <description>All models in the same army as Perturabo gain Furious Charge while in the enemy's deployment zone.  Additionally, an army with Perturabo as the warlord may begin rolling for reserves on turn 1 if wished.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="3706-cbcb-f75c-fe42" name="Precision Bombarment" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187" page="87" hidden="false">
          <description>Unless engaged in close combat or in reserve, Perturabo may call down a Precision Bombardment attack in the shooting phase once per game. Line of sight for this attack must be drawn from him or any friendly model equipped with a Nuncio-vox or Cortex Controller.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="6a94-7d8d-607f-f992" name="The Logos" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187" page="87" hidden="false">
          <description>Provides the following:

- 2 armour and 3+ Invulnerable save
- Close combat attacks using Perturabo's profile and AP value of 2
- Immunity to Concussive and Blind
- Wrist Cannon
- Deep strike special rule for himself and any Terminator-armoured units (of any type) with the Legiones Astartes (Iron Warriors)
- The following wargear:
---Teleport Transponder
---Cortex Controller
---Nuncio-vox
---Cognis Signum</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="3e54-e75d-fec7-9f9d" name="Cognis-signum" hidden="false" targetId="4687f5b1-f0b1-12bd-8cc7-27f9f25befaf" type="profile" />
        <infoLink id="b360-feda-2271-602d" name="Night Vision" hidden="false" targetId="a225-e39b-3699-c8f8" type="rule" />
        <infoLink id="3254-e72c-1c3e-4ba9" name="Very Bulky" hidden="false" targetId="abc9-8566-bb61-4b7c" type="rule" />
