      <rules>
        <rule id="088e-2098-5dd5-e782" name="Marked by Dark Fates" publicationId="ca571888--pubN92115" hidden="false">
          <description>In campaign games where character casualties and injury between battles is a factor, any such chart result may be re-rolled.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="0d44-10e3-ad7e-0511" name="Ahriman's Cabal" hidden="false">
          <description>Any Legion Command Squad taken for Ahriman must be upgraded to have the Brotherhood of Psykers special rule (Mastery Level 2) for 20 points. They always have the Cult Arcana: Corvidae and generate their psychic powers from the Divination discipline.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="0188-f667-597f-cd53" name="Warlord Trait: Pattern of Fates" hidden="false">
          <description>If Ahriman is your army's Warlord then he always uses this unique Warlord Trait. Pick up to three Troops units in your army with the Legiones Astartes (Thousand Sons) special rule before your eployed. lhese units gain the Scout special rule.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
