          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="d07a-b570-1364-24a0" name="Warlord: Chosen of the Khagan" hidden="false">
          <description>If Qin Xa is the army's Warlord, once per game the controlling player may choose to either bring a single eligible friendly unit into play from Reserve automatically instread of rolling or have it remain in Reserve for that turn.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="05b7-bf11-d6cb-6560" name="Master of the Keshig" hidden="false">
          <description>Any army the includes Qin Xa may select a Legion Command Squad with the Terminator Bodyguard Upgrade to represent the Keshig - this unit does not use up a HQ slot. Any model in the unit chosen to represent the Keshg may replace their power weapon with a power glaive for +10pts. If this option is used, the unit representing the Keshig must be deployed with Qin Xa as part of the unit during the deployment at the start of the game. (BS NOTE: This restriction must be done by the player).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
