          <selectionEntryGroups>
            <selectionEntryGroup id="accf706a-e747-5367-abb2-1c7def9f2ec0" name="HH 1.41 Disintegration Weapons" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true">
              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry id="575e8cc6-9ba6-5457-8a28-56719bcb391a" name="Disintegrator Blaster (replace combi-bolter)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="99.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="3906e216-d2b9-5eed-9ee1-c1664e9d9ccb" type="max" />
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="20.0" />
                  </costs>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="9ee64d67-cab5-5aee-8492-ed230edd9263" name="Disintegrator Blaster (replace combi-bolter)" hidden="false">
                      <description>PAGE 56
Disintegrator Weapons and Additions


Legion Nullificator Squad
        Any Legion Nullificator may replace their Combi bolter for a Disintegrator Blaster for 20 Points.

Legion Veteran Squads
        Legion Veteran Squads may replace their Bolt guns with one of the following

    -   Volkite Charger – 5 points
    -   Disintegrator Rifle – 10 points

        Legion Veteran Sergeants may replace their bolt pistol with a Disintegrator Pistol for 15 points.

        For Every 5 models in a Legion Veteran Squad, one Veteran may replace their bolt gun with one of the
        following:
        Disintegrator Blaster – 15 points
        Heavy Disintegrator – 25 points

Heavy Disintegrator

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        24’            6          2       Rapid Fire, Gets Hot!, Instant Death

Disintegrator Cannon

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        24”            9          2       Heavy 2, Gets hot!, Instant Death

Disintegrator Rifle

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        24’            4          3       Assault 1, Gets hot!, Instant Death

Disintegrator Blaster

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        18’            5          2       Rapid fire, Gets hot!, Instant Death

Disintegrator Pistol

        RANGE          S          AP      TYPE

        12’            4          3       Pistol 1, Gets Hot!, Instant Death</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
            </selectionEntryGroup>
          </selectionEntryGroups>
        </selectionEntry>
