    <selectionEntry id="5620-a878-b60d-17d4" name="Lion El'Jonson" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0" page="172" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <modifiers>
        <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
          <conditions>
            <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="e6fb-0e54-0be1-9ed1" type="equalTo" />
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
        <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
          <conditions>
            <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="25b6-d93f-bbd2-95a9" type="equalTo" />
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <constraints>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" id="ae37-bf11-de43-a37c" type="max" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="1aa1-6d70-621b-3907" name="Lion El'Jonson" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0" page="172" hidden="false" typeId="556e697423232344415441232323" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="556e6974205479706523232344415441232323">Infantry (Character)</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="575323232344415441232323">8</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="425323232344415441232323">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="5323232344415441232323">7</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="5423232344415441232323">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="5723232344415441232323">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="4923232344415441232323">7</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="4123232344415441232323">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="4c4423232344415441232323">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Save" typeId="5361766523232344415441232323">2+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="f3a7-fbe7-79c1-4d0f" name="The Leonine Panoply" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0" page="172" hidden="false" typeId="57617267656172204974656d23232344415441232323" typeName="Wargear Item">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">The Leonine Panoply provides a 2+ armour and 4+ Invulnerable save. The first failed Invulnerable save made for Lion El'Jonson each turn may be re-rolled.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="d0a3-956d-9e97-bc56" name="Sire of the Dark Angels" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0" page="172" hidden="false">
          <description>While Lion El'Jonson is on the battlefield, all friendly models with the Legiones Astartes (Dark Angels) special rule roll an additional D6 for all Morale checks and use the two lowest dice to decide the result of the check. Any units with the Legiones Astartes (Dark Angels) special rule within 12" of Lion El'Jonson add 1 to the Wound value used to determine which side has won a given close combat.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="3e7a-4911-4141-dcb2" name="The Point of the Blade" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0" page="172" hidden="false">
          <description>After declaring a Charge for Lion El'Jonson and any unit he has joined, the controlling player may choose to move 8" ignoring the effects of Difficult terrain or Dangerous terrain, instead of rolling for Charge range normally.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="3d76-6860-2811-2b60" name="The Lion's Choler" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0" page="172" hidden="false">
          <description>When reduced to 4 Wounds of less the Lion gainst +1 Attack, increased to +2 Attacks when reduced to 2 Wound or less.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="6ffa-a410-33c7-3233" name="An Absolute Focus" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0" page="172" hidden="false">
          <description>In any Assault phase, Lion El'Jonson is never required to roll more than a 4+ To Hit any enemy model, regardless of the enemy's Weapon Skill, any special rules or modifiers in play.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="c82f-e583-9adf-f049" name="Deathwing Companions" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0" page="172" hidden="false">
          <description>A unit of Deathwing Companions may be included as part of the same Lords of War choices as Lion El'Jonson. If selected, Lion El'Jonson must join this unit and may not voluntarily leave it during play.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="1cc4-d37c-a8e5-0351" name="Very Bulky" hidden="false" targetId="abc9-8566-bb61-4b7c" type="rule" />
        <infoLink id="66cf-cefc-36b5-db52" name="Crusader" hidden="false" targetId="2b06-29a6-641a-b22e" type="rule" />
      </infoLinks>
