              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="52616e676523232344415441232323">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="537472656e67746823232344415441232323">+2</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="AP" typeId="415023232344415441232323">2</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="5479706523232344415441232323">Melee, Shield Master*, Specialist Weapon, Master-crafted</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="d242-5459-0e7d-0e6f" name="Twinned Axe" hidden="false" typeId="576561706f6e23232344415441232323" typeName="Weapon">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="52616e676523232344415441232323">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="537472656e67746823232344415441232323">+1</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="AP" typeId="415023232344415441232323">2</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="5479706523232344415441232323">Melee, Rampage, Specialist Weapon, Two-handed, Master-crafted</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule id="60ef-6ebb-7156-9f2f" name="The Headsman &amp; The Hunter" hidden="false">
              <description>Fafnir Rann’s power axes, The Headsman &amp; The Hunter, are considered a single weapon with two proles – one representing Fafnir Rann using a single axe in concert with his shield and one representing Fafnir Rann using both axes at once. In each Fight sub-phase Fafnir Rann’s controlling player must choose one of these two proles to use for all of Fafnir Rann’s attacks. Note that the Shield Master special rule allows Fafnir Rann to make use of a weapon with the Two-handed special rule despite having a breaching shield.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0.0" />
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
